==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 250,000 and increases by 50,000 with each stage.
*5 [[Zoge]]s and 5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay between them is 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*[[Zory]] and [[Gory Dark]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the enemy base is damaged, [[Baron Seal]] spawns with:
**5 Zoges and 5 Doge Darks, same rate as before.
**Unlimited Zoges and Doge Darks, delay 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>.
**3 [[Zang Roo]]s and 3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s, delay 49.33 seconds<sup>1,480f</sup>.
**4 Zories and 4 Gory Darks, delay 58 seconds<sup>1,740f</sup>.

