==Strategies==
In this set of stages, the key is surviving all 3 Zang Roos. After that, the stages become much more manageable. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] are recommended, alongside many meatshields and other [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] who may prevent Zory from burrowing. [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and strong midrangers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] are also recommended for an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]]<nowiki>less</nowiki> approach, while more specific units should be used instead if one has them; [[The White Rabbit (Uber Rare Cat)|The Grey Fox]] and [[Mighty Drednot (Uber Rare Cat)|B.C.S. Tigerclaw]] are good examples. As for the [[Cat Cannon|Cannon]], [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] or [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] are recommended.

